m Amgen, AbbVie, Celltrion, F. Hoffmann-La Roche Inc., Janssen Inc., Merck, Pfizer Pharmaceuticals, Sandoz, and Sanofi Genzyme. H.S.-K. has received consultancies from Celltrion. T.K., S.K., S.Y. and D.-H.K. are full time employees of Celltrion Healthcare Co., Ltd. G.P. is a full-time employee of Celltrion, Inc. D.H.Y. reports personal fees for advisory board and speakers bureau from Celltrion, Inc. and has received research grants from Celltrion, Inc. outside of the submitted work.</p></sec><ref-list id="ref1"><title>References</title><ref id="keac689-B1"><label>1</label><mixed-citation publication-type="other">
