</string-name>, <string-name><surname>Pascart</surname><given-names>T</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Jelin</surname><given-names>G</given-names></string-name></person-group> &#x000a0;<etal>et al</etal> &#x000a0;<article-title>Are abatacept and tocilizumab intravenous users willing to switch for the subcutaneous route of administration? A questionnaire-based study</article-title>. <source>Clin Rheumatol</source> &#x000a0;<year>2017</year>;<volume>36</volume>:<fpage>1395</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>400</lpage>.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">28255739</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="keac689-B12"><label>12</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal">
